// The same query as ../as_at_release_by_year.dax on the hidden plain (naive) form of the measure, so that before and after run the same query.
// Slow measure 1, plain form, shaped like a matrix: Outturn as at Release by release (rows) and financial year (columns),
// the figure each of the 31 releases gave for each year it had reached.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Release'[Release Label],
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    "as_at", [Outturn as at Release (naive)]
)
ORDER BY 'Release'[Release Label], 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year]
